# Credential da tung nam trong lich su git cua repo nay — SHA-256 cua tung gia tri.
#
# Mot secret da push len git la mot secret KHONG rut lai duoc: no nam trong moi ban clone,
# moi fork, moi cache CI. Doi .env.example sang placeholder KHONG lam no het lo — chi lam
# phep so sanh 'khac .env.example chua?' ngung phat hien ra no. Danh sach nay la tri nho do.
#
# Luu HASH chu khong luu gia tri: file nay duoc commit, va commit lai chinh mat khau da lo
# la lap lai dung cai loi no dang ghi lai. Hash du de TU CHOI, khong du de DUNG.
#
# Sinh boi: git show <commit truoc khi doi>:.env.example | grep -E '_(PASSWORD|SECRET|TOKEN|KEY)='
# Them dong moi khi (va chi khi) mot credential nua bi lo. Khong bao gio xoa dong nao.

